  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feeding children in San Juan Bautista, Peru</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Our soup kitchen supports some of Lima&apos;s poorest and most vulnerable residents, 89 school-age children. However, this project has been operating with worn-out utensils and lacks adequate furniture especially as the number of beneficiaries has increased due to COVID-19. Many children are eating on the floors, often with their hands. With your help, we will provide new equipment that will increase the access to our food, as well as provide a space for educational reinforcement classes.</narrative>
  </description>
